Data

The MIT licence above covers the source code only. The data under shards/
is licensed by its publishers:

- OpenStreetMap data (shards/raw/sydney.osm.pbf, and the routing graph and
  place index derived from it under shards/graph/) © OpenStreetMap
  contributors, available under the Open Database License (ODbL) 1.0:
  https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright

- Transport for NSW Infrastructure Cycleway Data and NSW Crash Data
  (shards/raw/tfnsw_bicycle_network.zip, shards/raw/nsw_crash_*.xlsx, and
  the derived cycleway and crash attributes in shards/graph/) © State of
  New South Wales (Transport for NSW), licensed under Creative Commons
  Attribution 4.0: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
